  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You conjure a spectral bulb that sprouts from the ground in an unoccupied space you can see within range and lasts for the duration.</p><p>At the end of each of your turns, the bulb releases healing magic in a 10-foot Emanation: allies of your choice in it regain 5 Hit Points. The bulb vanishes once it has restored a total of 20 Hit Points.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</strong> The total Hit Points the bulb can restore increases by 5 for each spell slot level above 3.</p>",
